xcluding the combat knife you start with) and a very limited ranged weapon selection. And i personally believe that the campaign could have been longer but rumours stated a sequel which will now never happen, so that point would have been overruled. \nAll in all i love this game still so 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1412015888, "timestamp_updated": 1412015888, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12261362", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993551926", "personaname": "Lazureus", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Lazureus_Lyr/", "num_games_owned": 421, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 1204, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 446, "last_played": 1500149083, "avatar": "3f47c3634c822270cbccf23f4cb4fcf2272e23d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "EMPEROR PROTECTS", "timestamp_created": 1411829908, "timestamp_updated": 1411829908, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}